     =========================================================
     Geant4 - an Object-Oriented Toolkit for Simulation in HEP
     =========================================================

                    G4SKspallation1 History file
                    -----------------------
This file should be used by the GKSKspallation1 coordinators to briefly
summarize all major modifications introduced in the code and keep
track of all tags.

     ----------------------------------------------------------
     * Reverse chronological order (last date on top), please *
     ----------------------------------------------------------
     
30/04/20 G. D. V. Garcia (G4SKspallation1)
- Completion of the simulation containing the SK water tank and rock surroundings with muons arriving from the top of the tank uniformly distributed on the tank upper surface. Muon still has a defined single valued energy and not the energy spectrum required.
05/05/20 G. D. V. Garcia (G4SKspallation1)
- Addition of a scoring macro to set up a scoring mesh which returns the dE/dx profile and the quantity of certain particles produced.
07/05/20 G. D. V. Garcia (G4SKspallation1)
- Updated the physics list to a more accurate one for spallation studies(QGSP_BERT_HP).
13/05/20 G. D. V. Garcia (G4SKspallation1)
- Primary generator simplified for muons on top of the tank, centered and with w fixed energy of 271 GeV which is the average muon energy for SK.
15/05/20 G. D. V. Garcia (G4SKspallation1)
- Addition of histograms and ntuples with data simulated from each run and removal (commenting its creation lines) of the fiducial volume. 

